/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  pinch01_four_stream_classic -- meta-control

  The classic four-stream pinch-targeting exercise (two hot, two cold),
  in the tradition of Linnhoff & Hindmarsh, Chem. Eng. Sci. 38 (1983)
  745: with dTmin = 20 K the problem-table cascade gives
  Q_H,min = 107.5 kW, Q_C,min = 40 kW, pinch at 90 C (hot) / 70 C (cold).
  The targets here are HAND-CHECKABLE from the four CPs -- see the
  flowsheetDict header for the full table and the cascade worked by hand.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

application   choupoSolve;
description   "Pinch P1 targets: classic 4-stream problem table (dTmin 20 K)";

verbosity     3;
